  "full_passage_spoken": "Spring is warm. Flowers open up. A bird sings in the tree. A leaf turns green. A little rain falls. I see a butterfly. I like spring. Warm spring days open the flowers. A bird sings, and a butterfly follows the flower. Green leaves come after the rain. I like spring because the world feels new.",
  "topic_zh": "春天",
  "topic_pinyin": "chūn tiān",
  "voice_zh": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "full_passage_zh": "春天很温暖。花开放了。一只鸟在树上唱歌。叶子变绿了。下了一点小雨。我看见一只蝴蝶。我喜欢春天。温暖的春天让花开放。鸟儿唱歌，蝴蝶跟着花飞。雨后长出绿色的叶子。我喜欢春天，因为世界感觉是新的。",
  "full_passage_pinyin": "chūn tiān hěn wēn nuǎn。 huā kāi fàng le。 yī zhī niǎo zài shù shàng chàng gē。 yè zi biàn lǜ le。 xià le yì diǎn xiǎo yǔ。 wǒ kàn jiàn yī zhī hú dié。 wǒ xǐ huān chūn tiān。 wēn nuǎn de chūn tiān ràng huā kāi fàng。 niǎo ér chàng gē， hú dié gēn zhe huā fēi。 yǔ hòu zhǎng chū lǜ sè de yè zi。 wǒ xǐ huān chūn tiān， yīn wèi shì jiè gǎn jué shì xīn de。"
